{"kind":"deckhand.project","version":1,"savedAt":"2026-11-24T17:17:21.586Z","deck":{"src":"# Q3 Platform Review\nPrepared for the steering group, October 2026.\n\n## Where we are\n- Migration completed across all three regions\n- Latency down from 840ms to 190ms at p95\n- Two incidents, both resolved inside SLA\n- Cost per transaction fell 31%\n\n## Key numbers\nAvailability: 99.97%\nTransactions: 48.2m\nCost per txn: £0.004\nOpen incidents: 3\n\n## Incident summary\n| Ref | Subject | Severity | Status |\n|-----|---------|----------|--------|\n| 1041 | Latency spike | P2 | Closed |\n| 1042 | Failed callback | P3 | Closed |\n| 1043 | Cert rotation | P2 | Open |\n\n## Migration approach\n1. Freeze — stop schema changes and snapshot the primary\n2. Dual write — mirror traffic to the new cluster for 14 days\n3. Cutover — flip reads region by region\n4. Decommission — retire the legacy nodes\n\n## Build vs Buy\n### Build in house\n- Full control of the roadmap\n- No per-seat licensing\n---\n### Buy off the shelf\n- Live in six weeks\n- Vendor carries the compliance burden\n\n## The verdict\n> We should buy now and revisit building once volume justifies it.\n\n# Next quarter\n\n## Priorities\n- Close the remaining cert rotation work\n- Pilot the new reconciliation flow with two clients\n- Hire a second SRE\n- Move observability off the legacy stack\n- Finish the DR runbook\n- Review vendor pricing ahead of renewal\n\n## Thank you\nQuestions welcome.","theme":"slate","deckTitle":"Roundtrip Test","footerText":"","pageNums":true,"slides":[{"id":"sq1v2d05","type":"title","data":{"title":"Q3 Platform Review","subtitle":"Prepared for the steering group, October 2026.","meta":"","imgId":"ioif7mpv2"}},{"id":"ssbxiial","type":"bullets","data":{"title":"Where we are","items":[{"text":"Migration completed across all three regions","sub":""},{"text":"Latency down from 840ms to 190ms at p95","sub":""},{"text":"Two incidents, both resolved inside SLA","sub":""},{"text":"Cost per transaction fell 31%","sub":""}]}},{"id":"s8km3fzp","type":"metrics","data":{"title":"Key numbers","cards":[{"label":"Availability","value":"99.97","unit":"%","note":""},{"label":"Transactions","value":"48.2","unit":"m","note":""},{"label":"Cost per txn","value":"£0.004","unit":"","note":""},{"label":"Open incidents","value":"3","unit":"","note":""}]}},{"id":"spnloqxu","type":"table","data":{"title":"Incident summary","header":["Ref","Subject","Severity","Status"],"rows":[["1041","Latency spike","P2","Closed"],["1042","Failed callback","P3","Closed"],["1043","Cert rotation","P2","Open"]],"note":""}},{"id":"sazps45t","type":"steps","data":{"title":"Migration approach","steps":[{"title":"Freeze","text":"stop schema changes and snapshot the primary"},{"title":"Dual write","text":"mirror traffic to the new cluster for 14 days"},{"title":"Cutover","text":"flip reads region by region"},{"title":"Decommission","text":"retire the legacy nodes"}]}},{"id":"s1tdit0b","type":"compare","data":{"title":"Build vs Buy","left":{"heading":"Build in house","items":["Full control of the roadmap","No per-seat licensing"]},"right":{"heading":"Buy off the shelf","items":["Live in six weeks","Vendor carries the compliance burden"]}}},{"id":"s6sofpox","type":"statement","data":{"text":"We should buy now and revisit building once volume justifies it.","attrib":"The verdict"}},{"id":"saqe4nr9","type":"section","data":{"kicker":"","title":"Next quarter"}},{"id":"sug70xw8","type":"bullets","data":{"title":"Priorities","items":[{"text":"Close the remaining cert rotation work","sub":""},{"text":"Pilot the new reconciliation flow with two clients","sub":""},{"text":"Hire a second SRE","sub":""},{"text":"Move observability off the legacy stack","sub":""},{"text":"Finish the DR runbook","sub":""},{"text":"Review vendor pricing ahead of renewal","sub":""}]}},{"id":"sb6zrvlw","type":"closing","data":{"title":"Thank you","subtitle":"Questions welcome."}}]},"images":{"ioif7mpv2":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"}}